WEBVTT

00:00:12.104 --> 00:00:12.920
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Excuse me.

00:00:13.644 --> 00:00:15.918
Is there a cash machine near here?

00:00:16.663 --> 00:00:21.435
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Yes. There’s one at Barclays Bank.

00:00:22.142 --> 00:00:23.623
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Sorry, where is that?

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.049
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> Turn left and go straight on.

00:00:28.802 --> 00:00:32.815
Then turn right and it’s on the right.

00:00:33.122 --> 00:00:34.285
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Thanks very much.

00:00:34.286 --> 00:00:34.920
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> You’re welcome.